        "Use qsort for ordinary numeric columns instead of repeated adjacent swaps, retaining bubble sort for special columns where stability can affect observable floating-point representation.",
        "Replace the quadratic mode comparison loops with a single scan of sorted equal-value runs, retaining strict first-run tie selection."
      ]
